      <title>大模型边际毛利率92%却掉到17%：腾讯混元与智谱的成本真相</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260905/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E8%BE%B9%E9%99%85%E6%AF%9B%E5%88%A9%E7%8E%8792%E5%8D%B4%E6%8E%89%E5%88%B017%E8%85%BE%E8%AE%AF%E6%B7%B7%E5%85%83%E4%B8%8E%E6%99%BA%E8%B0%B1%E7%9A%84%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B8/</link>
